'''Falinks''' (Japanese: '''タイレーツ''' ''Tairetsu'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

