===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Falinks|155}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion; both cards have the Invade attack.
*'''Invade''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Falinks|155}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

